NC Digital offers fully managed starter websites for small businesses across Monmouth — a complete website package built, hosted, and managed for you from **£20 per month inc. VAT**. No upfront costs, no technical headaches.

## A professional Monmouth website without the hassle

Whether you're an independent business in Monmouth, a sole trader covering Monmouthshire, or just launching — a Managed Starter Website gets you online quickly with a professional result and zero ongoing effort on your part.

Every plan includes a professionally built website, your own custom domain, fast UK hosting with SSL, daily backups, and ongoing technical management. We also add new pages to your site every month.

